I'm waiting on the three investigations (navigation map, existing chat features, and the bug hunt with a test and typecheck run on a scratch copy). I'll write the plan once they report back.

The navigation map is back. It found:
- no back/history stack;
- a real Timeline `n` key conflict;
- stale key labels in the UI;
- three different group naming schemes;
- refresh replaying the boot screen;
- narrow panes losing their hotkeys.

Still waiting on the chat survey and the bug hunt before I write the plan.

